    {
      "section": "content.media-split",
      "variant": "text-left",
      "content": {
        "title": "Why belonging matters to us",
        "paragraphs": [
          "Lattice serves a worldwide community of data practitioners, and the product is better when the people building it reflect that community. Teams with a mix of backgrounds notice problems sooner, question assumptions more often, and design tools that work for a wider range of people and use cases.",
          "Belonging is not a side project for us. It shapes how we write job posts, run interviews, plan events and decide who gets the next stretch opportunity."
        ],
        "media": {
          "assetRole": "photo.composite-scene",
          "alt": "Illustration: volunteers at a community event",
          "ref": "/assets/pages/photos/photo-11.svg"
        }
      },
      "motion": {
        "pattern": "reveal.fade-up",
        "reducedMotionFallback": "show-immediately"
      },
      "style": {
        "columns": "7/5",
        "topPadding": "default"
      }
    },
    {
      "section": "content.media-split",
      "variant": "media-left",
      "content": {
        "title": "How belonging shows up here",
        "paragraphs": [
          "We treat inclusion like any other engineering problem: we set clear goals, measure honestly, ask people how the work feels, and change the process whenever the numbers or the feedback tell us that something is not working as intended.",
          "A few of the programs that came out of that work:"
        ],
        "bullets": [
          {
            "lead": "Structured interviews.",
            "text": "Every candidate for a role answers the same questions and is scored against the same written rubric."
          },
          {
            "lead": "Employee resource groups.",
            "text": "Groups led by employees get a budget, an executive sponsor and time during work hours."
          },
          {
            "lead": "Open pay bands.",
            "text": "Salary ranges are published on every job post and reviewed twice a year for fairness."
          }
        ],
        "after": [
          "We report our progress to the whole company **every six months**, including the areas where we **fell short**."
        ],
        "media": {
          "assetRole": "photo.composite-scene",
          "alt": "Illustration: attendees at a regional meetup",
          "ref": "/assets/pages/photos/photo-13.svg"
        }
      },
      "motion": {
        "pattern": "reveal.fade-up",
        "reducedMotionFallback": "show-immediately"
      },
      "style": {
        "columns": "5/7",
        "topPadding": "none"
      }
    },
    {
      "section": "content.media-split",
      "variant": "text-left",
      "content": {
        "title": "Growing a more inclusive data community",
        "paragraphs": [
          "Our responsibility does not stop at our own payroll. The data field still has too few paths in for people without a computer science degree or a network of contacts in the industry, so we invest in programs that open doors for newcomers and reward the mentors who hold those doors open for others. Those programs are planned with community members, not just for them.",
          "Every year we fund scholarships for our certification exam, host free beginner workshops in partnership with community organizers, and set aside speaking slots at our conference for first-time presenters. Community members help choose where that support goes, and we publish the results so that other companies can borrow what works and avoid what does not. Last year those programs reached learners in more than forty countries."
        ],
        "after": [
          "Interested in a scholarship? [Learn about certification](/certification) and apply in **any month of the year**. Applications are reviewed by a panel of volunteers from the community.",
          "Want to run a workshop near you? **Community organizers** can [join the community](/community/join) to get started, and we will send a starter kit with slides, exercises and sample data."
        ],
        "media": {
          "assetRole": "photo.composite-scene",
          "alt": "Illustration: a hackathon team at work",
          "ref": "/assets/pages/photos/photo-15.svg"
        }
      },
      "motion": {
        "pattern": "reveal.fade-up",
        "reducedMotionFallback": "show-immediately"
      },
      "style": {
        "columns": "7/5",
        "topPadding": "none"
      }
    },
